1
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:05,100
=The Truth (Season 4)=
(Behind-the-Scenes Cast Interview)

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,100
(Yang Kang, Chef Yang, The Divine Dish)
Tell us about the desserts you made.

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:07,870
First up,

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,110
we have a famous pastry

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,470
from Fujian and Taiwan,

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,870
pineapple cake.

7
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,350
It's filled with pineapple,

8
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:19,750
with a soft, crumbly crust.

9
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:24,630
The pineapple filling
is sweet and fragrant.

10
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,870
The second is a turtle cake.

11
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:31,070
It's a Fujian snack used as an offering.

12
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:31,630
This time,

13
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,910
we used mung bean pastry

14
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,870
for the crust

15
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,270
and shaped it

16
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,750
like a traditional turtle cake.

17
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:40,670
For the third,

18
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:44,630
we used Tieguanyin tea
from Anxi, Fujian...

19
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:45,110
Nice.

20
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:45,870
It's good.

21
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,070
To make chocolate.

22
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,700
How was acting
with the players for the first time?

23
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,430
It was fun.

24
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,550
They all left an impression.

25
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:56,340
If you could pick one player
for an escape room,

26
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:57,960
(Sun Leyan as Yan Reason)
who would you pick and why?

27
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,870
I'd probably pick Jin Jing

28
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:01,710
or Liu Yuning,

29
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:03,310
because I talked with them

30
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,989
the most today.

31
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,750
Jin Jing's the type

32
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,710
who, when you're scared,

33
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,870
can instantly pull you

34
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:11,510
into a fun mood,

35
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,350
so you won't feel as scared.

36
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:15,070
My shoes are perfectly fine.

37
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:18,190
Liu Yuning's more like a big brother.

38
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,550
Especially in scary scenes

39
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:24,070
where NPCs chase you,

40
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:26,030
in those

41
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,110
situations,

42
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:29,030
he could step in and protect everyone.

43
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:29,710
Yeah.

44
00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:31,140
From theater

45
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:32,910
(Lin Tan as Master Gui)
to playing an NPC on a mystery show,

46
00:01:32,910 --> 00:01:34,670
what's the biggest difference?

47
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,670
The biggest difference

48
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,910
is the unpredictability.

49
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,950
As an NPC,

50
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:42,110
you can't fully predict

51
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:46,030
what the players will say

52
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,070
in the moment

53
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,990
or what they'll do next.

54
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,990
So there's a lot of unpredictability.

55
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:51,710
In theater,

56
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,310
everything's already set.

57
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,140
But as theater

58
00:01:55,150 --> 00:01:55,710
has evolved,

59
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:57,270
immersive shows have become popular,

60
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,110
with audience interaction too.

61
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,390
So in a way,

62
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,630
they're pretty similar.

63
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,160
Yeah.

64
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,710
It's just a matter of degree.

65
00:02:03,410 --> 00:02:06,020
Which player impressed you most?

66
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:09,110
Jin Jing impressed me most.

67
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,710
I usually play characters

68
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,670
who work against the players

69
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,710
instead of helping them.

70
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:16,790
One look at her
and I instantly get fired up.

71
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:21,870
Jin Jing's really good at it.

72
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,790
We can argue back and forth

73
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,870
and bounce jokes off each other.

74
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,630
If you could pick one player
for an escape room,

75
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:30,600
who would you pick and why?

76
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:32,070
If I had to pick one,

77
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,750
I'd pick Liu Yuning.

78
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,990
I think he's

79
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,990
the brains of The Truth 4.

80
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,110
(The brains)
I'm not that smart,

81
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,390
so with him around,

82
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:43,270
we'd probably solve things

83
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,350
a lot more smoothly.

84
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,810
What kind of role would you
like to try next?

85
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,190
A psycho.

86
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,510
A thief.

87
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,110
(Villains)
All kinds of villains.

88
00:02:51,110 --> 00:02:54,330
What new character or gameplay
would you like to try next time?

89
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:55,390
For a new character,

90
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,430
maybe someone more complicated

91
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,590
and challenging,

92
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,110
or someone with multiple identities

93
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,910
(Challenge myself)
or multiple personalities.

94
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,350
Like a psycho,

95
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:03,710
you know?

96
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,310
I really like those kinds of roles.

97
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:08,250
(Meng Lingtai as Triple Lucky puppet)
Who would you pick

98
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:09,200
(Shi Zhongyuan as Triple Lucky vendor)
for an escape room?

99
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,120
(Zhou Jinglin as Triple Lucky puppet)
Why?

100
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,910
I'd pick Ding Chengxin.

101
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,310
There was one part

102
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:16,310
where we tested their teamwork.

103
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,070
They were way too in sync.

104
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,990
Something felt off.

105
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,670
Exactly.

106
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:23,310
Then I saw Ding Chengxin
crouching there.

107
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,310
I knew he was up to something.

108
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,470
He's really smart.

109
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,020
Really smart.

110
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,510
Super smart.

111
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,870
Very sharp.

112
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:31,990
What about you?

113
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,110
I'd pick Liu Yuning.

114
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,630
Why?

115
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:38,350
He's great at reasoning,

116
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,390
and his way of thinking

117
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,150
is really strong.

118
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,390
He's very capable.

119
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,790
Most importantly,

120
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,910
he keeps the game moving.

121
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:45,910
Good choice.

122
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:48,710
If it were up to me,

123
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:51,070
I'd probably pick Jin Jing.

124
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:53,070
She's really funny,

125
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,150
and she's not afraid

126
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,910
(Boss Jin's got you)
to interact with NPCs like us

127
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,750
or other characters in the game.

128
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,750
That helps move the story along

129
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:05,710
(You know it)
and helps them solve things faster.

130
00:04:06,410 --> 00:04:08,860
If you had to rank all six players
by courage,

131
00:04:08,860 --> 00:04:09,800
how would you rank them?

132
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,110
After what happened today,

133
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,110
I think all six players

134
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:15,070
are equally brave.

135
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,310
(Neck and neck)
If it were me,

136
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:19,750
I probably wouldn't dare go in.

137
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:22,730
If you could pick one player
for an escape room,

138
00:04:22,730 --> 00:04:24,320
(Yang Zhibo as fortune-telling vendor)
who would you pick and why?

139
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,710
I'd pick Zhang Linghe.

140
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:29,110
I think he's pretty smart

141
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,950
and really brave.

142
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,830
Plus, he has the Qide Sword.

143
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,150
The real Qide Sword.

144
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,430
I just remembered something.

145
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:40,590
Didn't I say I sold the Qide Sword?

146
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:41,590
So how did I get

147
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,030
that Qide Sword?

148
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,750
I didn't actually forge it.

149
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:46,630
One day,

150
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,230
I was walking down the road

151
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,110
and found it.

152
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,350
I suddenly saw someone ahead,

153
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,870
holding a wine gourd.

154
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,110
He was a mysterious man
reeking of booze.

155
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,390
So with Zhang Linghe,

156
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:59,230
I think we'd
have a better shot at winning.

157
00:04:59,450 --> 00:05:01,140
Forget the plot and logic for a moment.

158
00:05:01,140 --> 00:05:02,360
(He Wenjun as Junzi Ruyu)
Just acting-wise,

159
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,080
what kind of role would you like to try?

160
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:05,550
I really liked playing a swordsman

161
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,510
this time.

162
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,470
But what really bugs me is,

163
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,950
(Just teasing)
why is Li Fei my master?

164
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:12,910
Something about Longdong Army's beliefs.

165
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,310
This is the Longdong Spear.

166
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:14,830
This is...

167
00:05:14,860 --> 00:05:15,470
Right.

168
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,390
General Dong and the gate.

169
00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:18,700
Me?

170
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,550
People are already calling me

171
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,710
Little Li Fei.

172
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,990
Now he's my master too.

173
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,950
(Another day of progress)
I'm basically copying him now.

174
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:28,270
If you could pick one player
for an escape room,

175
00:05:28,270 --> 00:05:30,270
who would you pick and why?

176
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:32,790
I'd pick Jin Jing.

177
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,070
Why?

178
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:36,550
Everyone knows she loves rushing in.

179
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,870
So do I.

180
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,710
We'd get through the game faster.

181
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:40,980
Makes sense.

182
00:05:40,980 --> 00:05:41,750
Right?

183
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:44,190
I'd pick Liu Yuning.

184
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:44,750
(Only Ning will do)
Why?

185
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:47,310
During the game,

186
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:47,910
he's really upbeat

187
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,870
and always exploring...

188
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:50,470
Different possibilities.

189
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,400
He's always...

190
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:51,780
Yeah.

191
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:54,690
If you could pick one player
for an escape room,

192
00:05:54,690 --> 00:05:55,590
who would you pick?

193
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:57,790
I'd probably pick Zhang Linghe.

194
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,710
We know each other,

195
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,110
so it'd be easygoing.

196
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,350
Honestly, they'd all be great.

197
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,550
(Why choose? I'm going all in)
I'm not really

198
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,550
good at much.

199
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:04,870
I think

200
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,910
each of them makes up
for something I lack.

201
00:06:09,940 --> 00:06:10,840
=The Truth (Season 4)=

202
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:11,880
(SVIP updates Wed & Thu at noon)

203
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:12,940
(VIP updates next day at noon,
one week early)
